  "note": "Authored teaching scenario. Every transcription below was constructed to show how readers resolve a damaged mark. None of it was recorded from a real photocopier or a real reader.",
  "countingRule": "Compare the transcription to the card one character position at a time, within each labelled line. Every position where the two differ is one error. A position transcribed as U+00B7 (a middle dot) is an illegible, not a misreading, and is counted separately. Every transcription is the same length as the card, so no alignment judgement is needed.",
